    <name>Mixed L02B - Tempo 3x8 @ 82% + Sprints</name>
    <description>Mixed - level 2 of 10, variant B. Tempo 3x8 @ 82% + Sprints.

Structure: 10 min warm-up, 7:50 @ 82%, 10 s @ 160%, 4 min @ 55%, 7:50 @ 82%, 10 s @ 160%, 4 min @ 55%, 7:50 @ 82%, 10 s @ 160%, 13 min @ 60%, 5 min cool-down.

Coach notes: Each tempo block ends with a 10-second sprint on tired legs - like a race finish.

Estimated TSS: 49.</description>
